          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{COACH_NAME}} — personalized wellness coaching, frameworks and programs that build lasting habits.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0b0b0b; --paper:#ffffff; --muted:#9aa3a8; --accent:#ff8a65; --accent-2:#ffd54f; --large: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);\\n      --maxw:1100px; --radius:12px; --gap:24px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#070707 0%, #0b0b0b 100%);color:var(--paper);line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:48px auto;padding:32px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand svg{width:64px;height:64px}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:1.125rem;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.6px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a:hover{color:var(--paper);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:36px;align-items:start}\\n\\n    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));padding:36px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}\\n    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem}\\n    .headline{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.6vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.02;margin:10px 0 12px;color:var(--paper)}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n\\n    .contact-card{background:#071017;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .contact-card h3{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem}\\n\\n    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{background:#061217;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--paper);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:0.95rem}\\n    textarea{min-height:130px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    button.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ff7043);color:#081018;border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n\\n    .mini{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .pill{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);}\\n    .pill h4{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .teal{color:#6ee7b7}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    a.cta-link{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .mini{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <!-- unique local svg: avatar mark -->\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"{{COACH_NAME}}\\\" style=\\\"width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Voices</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a Call</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"hero-card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-head\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Let's build a sustainable rhythm</div>\\n        <h2 id=\\\"contact-head\\\" class=\\\"headline\\\">Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} — simple next steps for lasting healthy habits</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">No quick fixes. Together we'll map habits, use a small-step framework and design a schedule you actually keep. Start with a 20-minute clarity call or download the Habit Launch checklist to preview the method.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"mini\\\" aria-hidden>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n            <h4>Lead magnet</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Habit Launch checklist — instant PDF</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n            <h4>Popular path</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Momentum Path — 12-week stewardship</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n            <h4>Coaching style</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Gentle accountability + measurable wins</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--paper);\\\">Schedule a clarity call</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- small pattern svg for editorial texture -->\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;opacity:0.9\\\"><img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"decorative pattern\\\" style=\\\"width:120px;height:auto;opacity:0.9\\\"></div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"contact-card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"get-in-touch\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"get-in-touch\\\">Get in touch</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Prefer email or a quick phone note? Choose what works for you — below is a secure form to reach {{COACH_NAME}} directly.</div>\\n\\n        <form method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n          <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email — {{EMAIL}}\\\" required />\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"tel\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone — {{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n            <select name=\\\"topic\\\" aria-label=\\\"Reason for contacting\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"clarity\\\">Clarity call</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"program\\\">Programs & Paths</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"pricing\\\">Pricing & Tiers</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"other\\\">Other</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n          <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me briefly what you want to change or achieve\\\"></textarea>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Reach {{COACH_NAME}}</button>\\n            <a style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;text-decoration:none\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Or email: {{EMAIL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px;font-size:0.95rem\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Quick lines</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px\\\">\\n      <article style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\\\">\\n        <h3>How I work</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"meta\\\">My coaching uses a three-step framework: Observe, Micro-Design, Repeat. We track habits objectively, build tiny consistent actions, and refine until momentum sticks. No medical advice — just behavior design and clear accountability.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Framework snapshot</strong>\\n          <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <li>Observe — Collect one week of normal routine data</li>\\n            <li>Micro-Design — Create 1–3 tiny habit triggers</li>\\n            <li>Repeat — Schedule check-ins and tweak cadence</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\\\">\\n        <h3>Programs & Tiers (brief)</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Programs are tailored, with three main tiers to meet different rhythms of life and commitment.</p>\\n        <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <li><strong>Starter Pulse</strong> — 6 weeks, habit kickstart + checklist</li>\\n          <li><strong>Momentum Path</strong> — 12 weeks, weekly coaching, habit ledger</li>\\n          <li><strong>Stewardship</strong> — ongoing monthly coaching for habit maintenance</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"programs.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-link\\\">See all program details</a></div>\\n      </article>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:34px\\\">\\n      <h3>What clients say</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <blockquote style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);max-width:520px\\\">\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">\\\"The tiny habit framework made change feel possible. I went from burnout to two solid morning practices in eight weeks.\\\"</p>\\n          <cite style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">— Emma, freelance designer</cite>\\n        </blockquote>\\n        <blockquote style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);max-width:320px\\\">\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">\\\"Clear steps, gentle challenge — and accountability that didn’t feel like pressure.\\\"</p>\\n          <cite style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">— Andre, teacher</cite>\\n        </blockquote>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-link\\\">More stories</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>&copy; <span id=\\\"year\\\">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n      <div>Need help? <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- unique decorative hero svg—keeps brand local -->\\n  <svg style=\\\"display:none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n    <symbol id=\\\"hero-mark\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\">\\n      <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100\\\" height=\\\"100\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#0b0b0b\\\" />\\n      <circle cx=\\\"40\\\" cy=\\\"36\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#ff8a65\\\" />\\n      <path d=\\\"M18 70 C32 56, 68 56, 82 70\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffd54f\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" />\\n    </symbol>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Wellness Coach Site (aura_editorial)\\n\\nThis repository contains a small editorial-styled wellness coach web template optimized for clarity, habit-based frameworks, and conversion.\\n\\nFiles generated in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — contact page with form, mini-program summaries, lead magnet mention, and contact details.\\n\\nPlaceholders (replace these in your deployment):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — business or brand name\\n- {{TAGLINE}} — short tagline\\n- {{PHONE}} — phone number (tel: links included)\\n- {{EMAIL}} — contact email (mailto: links included)\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — primary button label (e.g., \\\"Book a Call\\\")\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — primary CTA URL or form action\\n- {{COACH_NAME}} — coach's full name\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}} — coach credentials for footer\\n- {{CITY}} and {{STATE}} — locality for contact card\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: aura_editorial — high contrast, bold typographic scale, editorial rhythm.\\n- Voice: coach_friend — energetic, reassuring, non-guru.\\n- The contact page intentionally \\\"ripples\\\" required sections (hero, framework, programs, pricing, testimonials, CTA) as concise references while keeping focus on conversion.\\n\\nAssets:\\n- The page references local SVGs in assets/img/: avatar.svg, pattern.svg, hero.svg. Create these files locally (unique vector art is required).\\n\\nAccessibility & UX:\\n- Form fields are labeled via placeholders and aria-label on the form; expand labels as needed for full WCAG compliance.\\n- All external links are relative to the generated pages: index.html, about.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html, contact.html.\\n\\nHow to use:\\n1. Replace placeholders with your real content or use a simple templating script to inject values.\\n2. Provide the SVG assets under assets/img/ to match the references used in contact.html.\\n3. Host static files on any static hosting provider (Netlify, Vercel, GitHub Pages).\\n4. If using the form, set {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} to your form endpoint or serverless function.\\n\\nDeveloper tips:\\n- Keep all fonts local or rely on system fonts; no external fonts or CDNs are referenced.\\n- Follow the editorial color scale in :root to tweak accent hues for brand alignment.\\n- Maintain unique headings and narrative across all other pages to preserve content diversity.\\n\\nLicense: Free to adapt for client work. Replace placeholder personal data before publishing.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
